{"duration_api_ms":10183,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"4baa5f36-5a23-496e-a961-057af98abb72","total_cost_usd":0.0012631,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":731,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":1727,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1332},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":731,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1727,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":731,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":731},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1274,"outputTokens":1979,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":731,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0012631,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":1558,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":731,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":1,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"**Rule 485(a) (new series of an existing trust):** The post-effective amendment generally becomes effective **75 days after filing** under Rule 485(a)(1), without a Commission order.\n\n**Why it isn't an end-to-end launch guarantee:**\n- **Effectiveness is only a legal milestone.** It doesn't cover exchange listing approval, ticker and CUSIP assignment, DTC setup, custodian and transfer-agent readiness, or authorized participant agreements.\n- **Staff comments can reset the timeline.** If the SEC staff comments, the registrant must respond, often with further amendments. Material changes can require a new filing, which restarts the clock.\n- **Filing completeness matters.** Missing financials, exhibits, or legal opinions can delay effectiveness.\n- **Seed capital and operations** must be in place before trading begins.\n\n**Initial registration of a new trust** differs. It uses Form N-1A under Section 8(a). Absent a delaying amendment, the registration becomes effective 20 days after filing. Most sponsors file a delaying amendment, so effectiveness waits for a Commission order. Rule 485(a) applies only after the trust is already registered.","ttft_ms":7031,"type":"result","duration_ms":8853,"uuid":"56ce64f5-2d0c-4031-ba46-281ccc427347","ttft_stream_ms":454,"time_to_request_ms":48,"first_content_frame_ms":454,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T06:36:39.484Z"}
